---
import FieldGuideLayout from '../../../components/FieldGuideLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<FieldGuideLayout
  title="RESO container"
  description="Konami's TOC-based archive: 16-byte header, N TOC entries (8 or 16 B each), payload region. 2,343 of 2,441 game files are RESO."
  crumbs={[
    { label: 'Field Guide', href: `${base}/field-guide/` },
    { label: 'File Formats', href: `${base}/field-guide/file-formats/` },
    { label: 'RESO' },
  ]}
>
  <p>
    Used by both <code>.ofs</code> (raw) and <code>.lzs</code> (post-LZ11)
    files. Reference parser: <code>src/archive/reso.py</code>.
  </p>

  <h2>Header (16 bytes)</h2>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Offset</th><th>Size</th><th>Type</th><th>Field</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>0x00</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>char[4]</code></td><td><code>magic</code></td><td><code>"RESO"</code> = <code>52 45 53 4F</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>0x04</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>u32 LE</code></td><td><code>file_count</code></td><td>Number of TOC entries</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>0x08</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>char[4]</code></td><td><code>version</code></td><td>Typically <code>"1.21"</code> = <code>31 2E 32 31</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>0x0C</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>u32 LE</code></td><td><code>variant</code></td><td><code>0</code> (type-tagged, 16-B stride) or <code>1</code> (simple, 8-B stride)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>TOC entry — variant 0 (16 bytes)</h2>
  <p>Used by configuration-style containers like <code>global.lzs</code>, <code>title_pack.ofs</code>, sprite atlases.</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Offset</th><th>Size</th><th>Type</th><th>Field</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>+0x00</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>u32 LE</code></td><td><code>unk</code> (often 0; in <code>tad</code> entries holds metadata)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x04</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>char[4]</code></td><td><code>type_tag</code> (reversed ASCII — see below)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x08</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>u32 LE</code></td><td><code>length</code> (payload bytes; 0 = empty slot)</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x0C</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>u32 LE</code></td><td><code>data_offset</code> (absolute offset within the RESO file)</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>TOC entry — variant 1 (8 bytes)</h2>
  <p>Used by message files (<code>data/message/**/*.ofs</code>), <code>talkstart/*.ofs</code>, and most plain data containers.</p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Offset</th><th>Size</th><th>Type</th><th>Field</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>+0x00</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>u32 LE</code></td><td><code>length</code></td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>+0x04</code></td><td>4</td><td><code>u32 LE</code></td><td><code>data_offset</code></td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Type tag values (variant 0)</h2>
  <p>
    The 4-byte <code>type_tag</code> is reversed ASCII. Reverse to recover the
    Nitro / Konami magic identifier.
  </p>
  <table>
    <thead><tr><th>Stored bytes</th><th>Reversed</th><th>Magic</th><th>Description</th><th>Count in corpus</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr><td><code>rgcn</code></td><td><code>NCGR</code></td><td><code>RGCN</code></td><td>Tile graphics</td><td>4,337</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>rlcn</code></td><td><code>NCLR</code></td><td><code>RLCN</code></td><td>Palette</td><td>2,600</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>recn</code></td><td><code>NCER</code></td><td><code>RECN</code></td><td>Cell / OAM definition</td><td>1,553</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>rcsn</code></td><td><code>NSCR</code></td><td><code>RCSN</code></td><td>BG screen / tilemap</td><td>1,128</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>rnan</code></td><td><code>NANR</code></td><td><code>RNAN</code></td><td>Animation</td><td>225</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>rtfn</code></td><td><code>NFTR</code></td><td><code>RTFN</code></td><td>Bitmap font</td><td>1</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>ncbr</code></td><td><code>NCBR</code></td><td><code>RBCN</code></td><td>Linear/bitmap NCGR variant</td><td>1</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>szl</code></td><td><code>lzs</code></td><td>—</td><td>Nested LZ11-compressed sub-RESO</td><td>34,464</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>sfo</code></td><td><code>ofs</code></td><td>—</td><td>Nested RESO (uncompressed)</td><td>333</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>tad</code></td><td><code>dat</code></td><td>—</td><td>Konami widget table (see <a href={`${base}/field-guide/file-formats/konami-extensions/`}>Konami extensions</a>)</td><td>694</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>nib</code></td><td><code>bin</code></td><td>—</td><td>Per-container binary blob (variable schema)</td><td>251</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>tbsn</code></td><td><code>nsbt</code></td><td><code>BTX0</code></td><td>3D texture pack (NSBTX)</td><td>8,773</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>mbsn</code></td><td><code>nsbm</code></td><td><code>BMD0</code></td><td>3D model (NSBMD)</td><td>297</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>cbsn</code></td><td><code>nsbc</code></td><td><code>BCA0</code></td><td>3D animation (NSBCA)</td><td>35</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>ymd</code></td><td><code>dmy</code></td><td>—</td><td>Dummy / placeholder script blob</td><td>15,712</td></tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h2>Payload region</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Payloads start at <code>0x10 + file_count × stride</code> (no special separator).</li>
    <li>Re-emit aligns each payload to a 16-byte boundary
      (<code>pad = (16 − len % 16) % 16</code>; pad bytes are <code>0x00</code>).</li>
    <li>Empty TOC slots have <code>length=0</code> and <code>data_offset=0</code>.</li>
    <li>Multiple TOC entries may share one <code>(length, data_offset)</code> —
      see <a href={`${base}/field-guide/message-system/shared-payloads/`}>shared payloads</a>.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Annotated hex dump — header + first 4 TOC entries</h2>
  <p>
    <code>data/message/msg00/00/msg00000.ofs</code> (variant 1, 100 entries):
  </p>
  <pre><code>{`offs  bytes                                              meaning
----  -------------------------------------------------- --------------------------------
0000  52 45 53 4F                                        magic = "RESO"
0004  64 00 00 00                                        file_count = 100
0008  31 2E 32 31                                        version = "1.21"
000C  01 00 00 00                                        variant = 1 (8-B stride TOC)

0010  08 00 00 00  30 03 00 00                           entry[0]: len=8, off=0x0330
0018  40 01 00 00  38 03 00 00                           entry[1]: len=320, off=0x0338
0020  EA 00 00 00  78 04 00 00                           entry[2]: len=234, off=0x0478
0028  20 01 00 00  62 05 00 00                           entry[3]: len=288, off=0x0562
... TOC continues for 96 more entries (100*8 = 800 bytes)
0330  ...                                                 payload region begins`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Variant-0 example: title_pack.ofs</h2>
  <pre><code>{`0000  52 45 53 4F  05 00 00 00  31 2E 32 31  00 00 00 00   header, file_count=5, variant=0
0010  00 00 00 00  6C 7A 73 00  00 F4 00 00  60 00 00 00   entry[0]: unk=0, tag="szl",
                                                            len=0xF400 (62464), off=0x60
0020  00 00 00 00  6C 7A 73 00  C0 5E 01 00  60 F4 00 00   entry[1]: tag="szl", len=89792
0030  ... 3 more 16-B entries ...
0060  11 10 27 00  ... LZ11 stream of inner RESO ...       payload[0] starts at 0x60`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Decoder reference</h2>
  <pre><code>{`# src/archive/reso.py
def parse(data: bytes) -> list[ResoEntry]:
    h = parse_header(data)
    stride = 0x10 if h.variant == 0 else 0x08
    entries = []
    for i in range(h.file_count):
        off = 0x10 + i * stride
        if h.variant == 0:
            unk          = u32(data, off + 0)
            type_tag     = data[off+4:off+8].decode("ascii")  # reversed
            length       = u32(data, off + 8)
            data_offset  = u32(data, off + 12)
        else:
            length       = u32(data, off + 0)
            data_offset  = u32(data, off + 4)
            type_tag     = ""
        entries.append(ResoEntry(i, type_tag, length, data_offset, unk))
    return entries`}</code></pre>

  <h2>Cross-references</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><a href={`${base}/field-guide/file-formats/lz11/`}>LZ11</a> — outer compression wrapper for <code>.lzs</code> files</li>
    <li><a href={`${base}/field-guide/file-formats/nitro-graphics/`}>Nitro graphics</a> — formats for <code>rgcn/rlcn/recn/rcsn/rnan</code></li>
    <li><a href={`${base}/field-guide/file-formats/konami-extensions/`}>Konami extensions</a> — <code>tad/nib/sfo</code></li>
  </ul>
</FieldGuideLayout>
